1
00:00:00,426 --> 00:00:02,714
As Uke comes to strike the side of your head,

2
00:00:02,815 --> 00:00:05,411
move in towards the strike controlling it,

3
00:00:05,412 --> 00:00:06,868
as you do so cut down,

4
00:00:06,869 --> 00:00:08,955
place Uke´s hand in front of you

5
00:00:08,956 --> 00:00:12,781
controlling Uke´s wrist
pivot the body completely to his rear,

6
00:00:13,082 --> 00:00:14,031
raise the arm up

7
00:00:14,032 --> 00:00:17,561
cut down and place Uke in front of you.

